<title>UK: NatWest leads 972 million stg asset-backed deal.</title>
<headline>NatWest leads 972 million stg asset-backed deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenwich NatWest said on Monday it was lead manager of a 972 million stg multi-tranche asset-backed issue launched in the name of Finance for Residential Social Housing Plc (FRESH).</p>
<p>The notes are backed by Housing Association loans originated by the Housing Corporation and Housing for Wales (Tai Cymru).  </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>Series 1 Asset Backed Premium Notes due October 2058</p>
<p> CLASS	   1-A1	  1-A2	  1-A3	  1-B</p>
<p> AMOUNT	  727,883,549 115,905,023 37,089,607  37,089,607</p>
<p> S&amp;P	     AAA	   AAA	   AAA	   BBB*</p>
<p> AVG LIFE	28.6 YRS    19.5 YRS    28.6 YRS    28.7 YRS</p>
<p> SPREAD	  60 BP	 80 BP	 80 BP	 100 BP</p>
<p>SERIES 1 - COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> BENCHMARK  8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2021	   FEES	  0.625</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 PAYDATE     26.MAR.97</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES     *ALSO BAA3 MOODYS. COUPON DATES MAR.31, SEP.30.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>Series 2 Asset Backed Premium Notes due April 2027</p>
<p> CLASS	   A	     B</p>
<p> AMOUNT	  40,915,504  3,113,136</p>
<p> MOODYS/S&amp;P    AA1/AAA     BAA3/BBB</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>Series 3 Asset Backed Premium Notes due April 2027  CLASS	   A</p>
<p> AMOUNT	  9,717,135</p>
<p> MOODYS/S&amp;P    UNRATED</p>
